WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.366
I load the real model from this computer. No remote API is used.

2
00:00:04.366 --> 00:00:07.695
I analyze the starting text. Tokens and probabilities come from the model.

3
00:00:07.695 --> 00:00:10.206
I save A, then change only temperature, from 0.8 to 1.5.

4
00:00:10.206 --> 00:00:12.700
Probabilities spread out; the most likely token keeps its top rank.

5
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:16.153
Now I change context: France instead of Italy. Temperature returns to 0.8.

6
00:00:16.153 --> 00:00:19.308
I sample one token from the full vocabulary. The generated text joins the context.

7
00:00:19.308 --> 00:00:24.959
I generate a short continuation. I can stop subsequent steps.

8
00:00:24.959 --> 00:00:27.394
I reset the results. The model stays loaded in memory.

9
00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:29.797
Real recording. High probability does not mean a true fact.
